{%- doc -%}
  Pix logo. Pix is paid through Appmax/Mercado Pago, so Shopify does not list it
  in `shop.enabled_payment_types` and `payment_type_svg_tag` has no artwork for it.

  @param {string} [variant] - 'card' renders the payment-icon card (38x24) used in
    payment icon lists; omit it for the bare symbol.

  @example
  {% render 'icon-pix', variant: 'card' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

